{"articleNo":"120216","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=120216&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2015년 기아드림(Dream) 장학금 (교통사고 유자녀 장학금) 신청안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2015.01.02","hit":"4049","attachments":[{"name":"기아드림(Dream)장학금(교통사고유자녀장학금)신청안내(공문).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=120216&attachNo=4183"},{"name":"기아드림장학금신청(추천서양식).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=120216&attachNo=4207"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment--><p style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2015</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">년도 기아드림</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(Dream) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">장학금</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">교통사고 유자녀 장학금</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">신청 안내</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; <!--?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">기아자동차</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">주</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">와 한국사회복지협의회는 교통사고로 피해를 입은 세대의 유자녀에게 장학금을 통해 학업을 지원하고 있습니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">본 사업 지원 대상에 해당되는 학생은 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\">「</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">교통사고 유자녀 장학금 지원사업</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\">」 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">신청 안내문</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">붙임</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">을 필독하셔서 기한까지 장학금 신청서류를 접수하여 주시기 바랍니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">가</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">대 상 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">:자동차 교통사고로 인하여 사망 혹은 중증후유장애(1~4급)를&nbsp; 입은 자의 유자녀(초,중,고, 대학교 재학중이여 함.)&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">나</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">접수기한 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 2015.01.05(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">월</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) ~ 2015.01.30.(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">금</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">도착분까지</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">접수방법 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">더나눔</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(www.thenanum.net) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">및 복지넷</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(<a href=\"http://www.bokji.net/\">www.bokji.net</a>)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">에서 신청서 다운로드</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><font style=\"\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffff\"><font color=\"#2f9d27\"><strong><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">*</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">대학생은 반드시 학교를 통해서만 신청해야하므로 해당 학생은 신청 자료를 모두 구비하여 </span><font color=\"#ff007f\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2015</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">년 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">01</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">월</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">26</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">일</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">월</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\"><font color=\"#ff007f\">까지 </font>학생처</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; m